{title: Kajra Mohabbat Wala}
{artist: Asha Bhosle O P Nayyar}
{key: G}

{c: Verse 1}
[G]Kajra mohabbat wala
[G]ankhiyo me aisa dala
[G]Kajre ne le [F]lee meree jaan,
[D]hai re [G]mai teree kurban
[G]Duneeya hai mere pichhe,
[G]lekin mai tere pichhe
[G]Apna bana [F]le meree jaan,
[D]hai re [G]mai tere kurban
[G]Aayee ho kaha se goree
[D]aankho me [G]pyar leke
[G]Chadhatee javanee ye
[D]ki pehle [G]bahar leke
[C]Dehli shaher ka sara
[G]mina bajar leke
[G]Jhumka barelee wala
[G]kaano me aisa dala
[G]Jhumke ne le [F]lee meree jaan,
[D]hai re [G]mai tere kurbaan
[G]Motor na bangla mangu
[D]jhumka na [G]har mangu
[G]Dil ko chalane wale
[D]dil ka [G]karar mangu
[C]Saiyan bedardee mere
[G]thoda sa pyar mangu
[G]Kismat bana de meree,
[G]duneeya basa de meree
[G]Kar le [F]sagai meree jaan,
[D]hai re [G]mai tere kurban
[G]Jab se hai dekha tujhko,
[D]ho gaye [G]ghulam tere
[G]Apna bana le goree,
[D]aayenge [G]kam tere
[C]Apna yeh jivan sara
[G]likh denge nam tere
[G]Kurta yeh jali wala,
[G]us par motiyan kee mala
[G]Kurte ne le [F]lie meree jaan,
[D]hai re [G]mai teree kurbaan
